<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<catalogue id="6913-1313-195f-b307" name="Hawiian Koa" revision="3" battleScribeVersion="2.03" authorName="Jono Firth" authorUrl="https://www.greatescapegames.co.uk/uploads/images/wysiwyg/home-shortcuts/coe/American/Hawaiian_Koa_May_2012.pdf" library="false" gameSystemId="c749-87c2-0d4a-5e29" gameSystemRevision="12" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <readme>This army list covers the people and kingdoms of the Hawaiian Islands from the foundation of the Hawaiian culture all of the way up to the campaign for unity that was lead by the Hawaiian warrior king, Kamehameha the Great. The main historical enemies of the Hawaiians were Tahitians, Polynesians, European Sailors (Buccaneers) and other Hawaiians.

A Hawaiian Koa Army must include general and at least 3 Spearman units.</readme>
